Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.93,0:00:08.77,Default,,0,0,0,,YAMU, YAMU, YAMU, YAMU,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.91,0:00:09.74,Default,,0,0,0,,YAMU,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.82,0:00:16.77,Default,,0,0,0,,YAMU!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.01,0:00:31.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Your moves!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.67,0:01:15.39,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.47,0:01:22.47,Default,,0,0,0,,know.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.01,0:01:30.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.21,0:01:32.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaiba!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.39,0:01:35.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Call off your dragon, I give, I give!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.67,0:01:36.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Poor scared Joey.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.17,0:01:41.76,Default,,0,0,0,,He calls himself a duelist, but he's\Njust a little puppy dog cringing in fear.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.07,0:01:43.57,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not scared of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.89,0:01:46.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Bad dog, don't contradict your master.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.89,0:01:49.48,Default,,0,0,0,,You're not my - Quiet, sit.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.37,0:01:51.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.75,0:01:54.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Sit at your master's\Nfeet, where you belong.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.75,0:02:06.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.23,0:02:08.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.61,0:02:10.47,Default,,0,0,0,,A dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.51,0:02:16.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaiba, we'll see who he's\Nthe dog chow on this island.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.49,0:02:18.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Everybody, wake up.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.01,0:02:21.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Joey, what's wrong? What is it, Joey?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.69,0:02:23.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Nah, nothing's wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.47,0:02:28.05,Default,,0,0,0,,It's just a brand new day at a\Ntournament, and I'm hot to find us a duel.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.29,0:02:29.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, you don't have to yell about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.01,0:02:31.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.39,0:02:32.86,Default,,0,0,0,,What's all the commotion?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.69,0:02:34.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Good morning, Taya.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.75,0:02:35.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Where's Mai?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.79,0:02:36.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Isn't she with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.89,0:02:38.25,Default,,0,0,0,,She said she had to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.55,0:02:40.43,Default,,0,0,0,,And to give you this note, Yuki.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.17,0:02:42.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.08,0:02:42.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.01,0:02:45.53,Default,,0,0,0,,I owe you eight star chips.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.81,0:02:47.09,Default,,0,0,0,,See you around, Mai.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.67,0:02:49.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, kiss those chips goodbye.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.47,0:02:51.39,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.81,0:02:53.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe we really can trust Mai.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.79,0:02:58.77,Default,,0,0,0,,And if not, well, we're still\Nthe Team Supreme, right? Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.51,0:03:01.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, then. Move out.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.73,0:03:03.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.11,0:03:13.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I wonder how many duelists\Nthere are left on the island.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.55,0:03:15.73,Default,,0,0,0,,They shipped a couple\Ndozen home yesterday.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.81,0:03:18.43,Default,,0,0,0,,And I bet even more have\Nbeen eliminated by now.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.51,0:03:22.45,Default,,0,0,0,,And some of them were really good\Nplayers with powerful cards, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.53,0:03:23.73,Default,,0,0,0,,We could be next.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.99,0:03:25.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Not a chance, Yug.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.49,0:03:27.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Those other guys just wanted the prize.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.33,0:03:29.37,Default,,0,0,0,,You and Joey have a lot more at stake.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.45,0:03:30.28,Default,,0,0,0,,That's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.49,0:03:32.37,Default,,0,0,0,,I've got to rescue Grandpa from Pegasus,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.45,0:03:34.69,Default,,0,0,0,,and Joey needs the prize\Nmoney to help his sister.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.77,0:03:37.93,Default,,0,0,0,,And the duelists we face\Ntoday will be even stronger,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.07,0:03:40.31,Default,,0,0,0,,because they survived the first round.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.89,0:03:41.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Even stronger?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.79,0:03:44.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Careful what you say, Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.49,0:03:47.17,Default,,0,0,0,,You've got little Joey here\Nshaking in his sneakers.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.25,0:03:48.08,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.16,0:03:49.16,Default,,0,0,0,,You think I'm a scared little puppy dog?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.25,0:03:50.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, if the collar fits...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.97,0:03:52.57,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, break it up.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.79,0:03:55.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, you just bring on any duelist.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.53,0:03:56.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Then I'll cream him.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.51,0:03:58.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.42,0:04:00.53,Default,,0,0,0,,You gotta believe in yourself, Joey.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.75,0:04:01.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, that's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.67,0:04:03.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Cause nobody else does.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.61,0:04:07.09,Default,,0,0,0,,I want that one.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.57,0:04:12.67,Default,,0,0,0,,If you like him tall, skinny and stupid\Nbones, that geek one sure fits the bill.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.65,0:04:15.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah, you'll demolish him.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.11,0:04:23.95,Default,,0,0,0,,So, who are they anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.99,0:04:27.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Will you just keep your shirt on, Sid?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.45,0:04:30.23,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm trying to see if I can\Nget a tighter focus on him.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.31,0:04:31.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, me as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.25,0:04:34.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't know who the others are, but I\Nthink that little runt is that Yugi kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.95,0:04:35.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.86,0:04:37.19,Default,,0,0,0,,He's the one who beat Kaiba.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.59,0:04:38.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.50,0:04:41.79,Default,,0,0,0,,We better tell the boss\Nabout this, Saigur. Right on.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.59,0:04:49.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Alright, spit it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.31,0:04:50.85,Default,,0,0,0,,We found two duelists.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.09,0:04:52.61,Default,,0,0,0,,One's just a stupid git.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.69,0:04:54.77,Default,,0,0,0,,But the other one's a good duelist.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.93,0:04:56.75,Default,,0,0,0,,That kid's name is Yugi, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.53,0:04:59.33,Default,,0,0,0,,He's the kid who beat Kaiba.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.41,0:05:03.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Everybody figures him to make it\Nall the way to Pegasus' castle.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.23,0:05:05.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.31,0:05:06.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I heard of him.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.25,0:05:09.33,Default,,0,0,0,,He's supposed to be a tough little squirt.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.41,0:05:13.39,Default,,0,0,0,,That is, if you believe in his\Nreputation. Huh? Yeah. Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.71,0:05:15.06,Default,,0,0,0,,We never seen him duel.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.23,0:05:17.31,Default,,0,0,0,,How do we know how good Yugi really is?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.39,0:05:18.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.35,0:05:20.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Nobody's going to the castle except us.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.51,0:05:21.83,Default,,0,0,0,,because we're teamed up with the most
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.91,0:05:24.67,Default,,0,0,0,,brilliant bloomin' duelist\Non the whole island.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.75,0:05:25.58,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.71,0:05:29.83,Default,,0,0,0,,So if you bums want to win this\Ntournament, you'll keep your traps shut.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.91,0:05:34.32,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll keep cool, and you'll let Bandit\NKeith do all your thinking for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.53,0:05:36.45,Default,,0,0,0,,No argument from me, boss.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.89,0:05:38.24,Default,,0,0,0,,You got all the brains.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.35,0:05:39.53,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm just a muscle.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.83,0:05:43.01,Default,,0,0,0,,And we'll hammer any blinkin'\Nduelist who gets in our way.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.09,0:05:43.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Any blinkin' duelist.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.00,0:05:45.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Hear that, Pegasus?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.23,0:05:46.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Soon it'll be payback time.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.97,0:05:50.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Payback for the way you\Nhumiliated me at the
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.23,0:05:52.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Duel Monsters\NIntercontinental Championship.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.85,0:05:57.50,Default,,0,0,0,,It had all come down to you against me,\Nand I had you right where I wanted you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.79,0:06:00.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.70,0:06:02.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Any final words, mullet head?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.75,0:06:04.61,Default,,0,0,0,,I was sure I was about to win,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.83,0:06:08.61,Default,,0,0,0,,but you just scribbled some notes and\Ncalled over a kid from the audience.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.69,0:06:10.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, what are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.39,0:06:11.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Asking for help's illegal!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.59,0:06:14.03,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't need help.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.25,0:06:16.77,Default,,0,0,0,,A child could defeat you, Bandit Keith.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.85,0:06:18.53,Default,,0,0,0,,and I'm going to prove it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.95,0:06:21.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Just follow these\Ninstructions and you'll win.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.77,0:06:24.71,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't know what to make of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.79,0:06:27.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Were you just trying to psych\Nme out or did you chicken out?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.01,0:06:32.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Either way, it was fine by me so\Nlong as I took home the prize money.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.45,0:06:34.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, punk, beat this.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.67,0:06:37.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Good car, but the note\Nsays when you play that,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.01,0:06:40.25,Default,,0,0,0,,I should play this one in attack mode.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.77,0:06:41.73,Default,,0,0,0,,No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.33,0:06:44.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh, I think I just took\Nall your life points.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.57,0:06:46.40,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.48,0:06:47.80,Default,,0,0,0,,You little snot-nosed brat.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.89,0:06:50.73,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no way you could have known\NI was going to play that card.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.81,0:06:51.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Give me that.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.72,0:06:52.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.73,0:06:54.61,Default,,0,0,0,,It's all here.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.79,0:06:57.38,Default,,0,0,0,,The card I play, how\Nto beat it, everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.47,0:06:58.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Sam is the winner.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.99,0:07:03.03,Default,,0,0,0,,You may have defeated\Nme, Pegasus. Cheated me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.23,0:07:06.15,Default,,0,0,0,,But nobody makes a fool out of Bandit Key.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.87,0:07:09.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, you said you found two duelists?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.23,0:07:11.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, Yuki and some dweeb named Joey.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.45,0:07:13.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.36,0:07:14.87,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll take the dweeb out first.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.39,0:07:18.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you hear that?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.75,0:07:20.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I think we're being followed.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.19,0:07:23.99,Default,,0,0,0,,I think that you're getting\Na little paranoid, Joey.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.07,0:07:27.05,Default,,0,0,0,,You've been acting hyper ever\Nsince you woke up this morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.13,0:07:29.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Man, what the heck is eating you anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.81,0:07:32.47,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm telling you, somebody's stalking us.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.35,0:07:34.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Where are you going?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.71,0:07:35.69,Default,,0,0,0,,To stalk them!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.13,0:07:45.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Boss, where are we headed?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.25,0:07:47.67,Default,,0,0,0,,To a hidden arena.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.09,0:07:49.05,Default,,0,0,0,,In a cave?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.21,0:07:59.09,Default,,0,0,0,,You ought to feel right\Nat home down here, Bones.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.31,0:08:02.61,Default,,0,0,0,,It's dark and dank and really\Ncreepy, just like you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.69,0:08:07.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Your deck, uh, you did load it up\Nmostly with zombie cards, didn't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.75,0:08:08.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.33,0:08:11.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me see what you got there.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.99,0:08:18.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Good, but I think you could\Nuse a little more brute force.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.29,0:08:19.83,Default,,0,0,0,,But where could I find...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.91,0:08:21.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you worry, kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.75,0:08:25.45,Default,,0,0,0,,I got all the power you\Nneed right here to build
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.53,0:08:28.53,Default,,0,0,0,,the strongest zombie deck\Nin Duel Monsters history.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.87,0:08:32.16,Default,,0,0,0,,It's time we moved on to the graveyard.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.05,0:08:34.09,Default,,0,0,0,,The Graveyard?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.41,0:08:37.63,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a perfect arena for you, Bones.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.91,0:08:41.26,Default,,0,0,0,,And with all these new zombie\Ncards, you just can't lose.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.01,0:08:42.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks, boss.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.15,0:08:45.79,Default,,0,0,0,,And you can bet that I won't let you down.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.39,0:08:49.85,Default,,0,0,0,,You better not or you're gonna\Nfind yourself in a world of hurt.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.93,0:08:52.17,Default,,0,0,0,,You wouldn't want that now, would you?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.75,0:09:01.17,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you afraid of?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.25,0:09:03.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Some musty old skull. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.09,0:09:05.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Give me a break.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.13,0:09:07.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Your face is scarier than this old thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.47,0:09:13.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh, boss, wait for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.33,0:09:16.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe Paya was right.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.97,0:09:19.21,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess all I heard was the waterfall.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.33,0:09:21.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Can I help you?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.11,0:09:25.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Wake up, dweeb.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.11,0:09:28.94,Default,,0,0,0,,You!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.41,0:09:32.11,Default,,0,0,0,,What? Where am I?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.13,0:09:35.61,Default,,0,0,0,,The boss wants you off!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.29,0:09:42.97,Default,,0,0,0,,What is this place?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.97,0:09:49.33,Default,,0,0,0,,A tombstone?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.27,0:09:55.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Welcome, duelists, to\Nthe arena of lost souls.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.63,0:10:01.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Abandon hope, for no duelist\Ngets out of here alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.13,0:10:03.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Help, my ghost!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.45,0:10:14.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Joey's been gone an awfully long time.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.75,0:10:16.45,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't suppose he got lost?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.53,0:10:19.57,Default,,0,0,0,,No way, but he could have\Nbeen challenged to a duel.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.65,0:10:20.79,Default,,0,0,0,,I bet that's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.13,0:10:24.41,Default,,0,0,0,,I must have gotten his case a\Nlittle too hard about being scared,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.49,0:10:27.43,Default,,0,0,0,,So now he's gone off to\Nfight a duel all by himself.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.51,0:10:30.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, let's split up and\Ntry to find him. Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.87,0:10:32.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi and Teya, you head that way.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.97,0:10:34.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Bakura and I will go this way.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.49,0:10:35.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.23,0:10:41.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Prepare for your final duel.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.15,0:10:45.07,Default,,0,0,0,,This arena will be your graveyard.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.59,0:10:46.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Ooh, spooky.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.87,0:10:48.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Spot on, mate.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.21,0:10:51.09,Default,,0,0,0,,He's got the dweeb scared stiff.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.23,0:10:52.71,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't believe it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.79,0:10:55.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks like the guy fainted on his feet.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.27,0:10:58.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, so do something, Sigour.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.77,0:11:00.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Get busy and wake him up.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.63,0:11:01.91,Default,,0,0,0,,You heard him, dweeb.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.05,0:11:02.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Rise and shine.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.15,0:11:07.91,Default,,0,0,0,,The ghosts of the dead\Nare all around you, Joey.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.29,0:11:10.99,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no way to escape from your fear.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.71,0:11:12.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.62,0:11:13.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Who says I'm scared?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.03,0:11:16.99,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't hide the truth\Nfrom the spirits, Joey.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.41,0:11:20.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow, they see you frozen in fear.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.63,0:11:22.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, I was afraid.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.79,0:11:26.08,Default,,0,0,0,,But not because of the graveyard\Nor your ooga-booga rap.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.19,0:11:29.21,Default,,0,0,0,,It's your creepy face\Nthat gave me the willies!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.07,0:11:32.53,Default,,0,0,0,,You have to admit he's got a point, Bones.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.61,0:11:36.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, you even spooked me out,\NBones, and I'm on your side.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.59,0:11:40.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, if you're on my side,\Nthen stop laughing at me!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.07,0:11:43.91,Default,,0,0,0,,So are we going to duel or\Njust stand around talking?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.99,0:11:45.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Lay down your star chips now!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.83,0:11:50.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, I never even agreed\Nto this duel. Tough luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.83,0:11:52.83,Default,,0,0,0,,You haven't got any choice, dweeb.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.55,0:11:57.91,Default,,0,0,0,,There has to be some way out of this!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.55,0:11:59.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.46,0:12:00.45,Default,,0,0,0,,You want a way out?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.67,0:12:04.97,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll hand over all your star chips and\Ncrawl out like a scared little puppy dog!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.05,0:12:06.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Bad doggy!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.01,0:12:09.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Puppy dog?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.35,0:12:14.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Sit at your master's\Nfeet, where you belong!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.21,0:12:21.92,Default,,0,0,0,,If I run from this, I really will\Nbe a scared little puppy dog.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.35,0:12:24.15,Default,,0,0,0,,So I'll just have to beat you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.75,0:12:26.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Four star chips.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.39,0:12:29.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Nice going boss.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.83,0:12:31.09,Default,,0,0,0,,He fell for it
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.91,0:12:33.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's do.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.25,0:12:40.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Put him away quick, bones! Send him\Nstraight to the grave with a zombie card.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.21,0:12:42.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah a zombie card
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.25,0:12:47.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Yikes, now I get what he's up\Nto. You don't stand a chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.31,0:12:49.67,Default,,0,0,0,,This arena's one big graveyard field.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.91,0:12:53.35,Default,,0,0,0,,And all my zombie cards get\Na field power bonus here.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.31,0:12:55.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Joey? Joey?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.55,0:12:59.43,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no sign of him anywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.77,0:13:01.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, let's look over that way.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.45,0:13:04.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Joey?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.91,0:13:05.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Joey!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.43,0:13:08.43,Default,,0,0,0,,He's not here.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.63,0:13:09.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Where could he be?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.61,0:13:13.20,Default,,0,0,0,,If he were fighting a duel, I'm\Nsure that we'd see the arena.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.53,0:13:14.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Joey's just vanished.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.11,0:13:16.31,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm worried, Taya.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.39,0:13:26.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Here goes my zombie card. Not so fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.69,0:13:30.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold that card for now.\NPlay the one on the
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.93,0:13:34.01,Default,,0,0,0,,far left instead play the one on the left
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.09,0:13:38.77,Default,,0,0,0,,boss but that card is zanky zanky's not a
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.85,0:13:43.63,Default,,0,0,0,,zombie card at all you needed some raw\Nmuscle so i slipped it into your deck bones
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.71,0:13:48.65,Default,,0,0,0,,but if it's not a zombie card it won't get\Nthe field power bonus from the graveyard.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.89,0:13:50.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't argue with me, Squirt.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.43,0:13:52.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Just do what I tell you. What?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.73,0:13:54.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Play the card.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.17,0:13:56.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Bandit, Keith won't steer you wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.03,0:13:57.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Right, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.94,0:14:00.92,Default,,0,0,0,,How could any of us have gotten this\Nfar without following all his advice?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.01,0:14:01.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.92,0:14:02.75,Default,,0,0,0,,What is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.83,0:14:03.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Dueling by committee?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.75,0:14:05.57,Default,,0,0,0,,You're going to play\Nthe card or aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.65,0:14:06.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Right, boss.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.61,0:14:07.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Whatever you say.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.83,0:14:10.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Zeggy, in attack mode.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.27,0:14:17.41,Default,,0,0,0,,This'll put a dent in Zanki's armor.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.93,0:14:21.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Go, X-Raider, attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.47,0:14:24.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Windblades!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.13,0:14:32.95,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, so much for\Nyour armored warrior.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.61,0:14:35.13,Default,,0,0,0,,He wiped me out.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.59,0:14:37.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks that way.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.13,0:14:40.35,Default,,0,0,0,,So why did you make me play that late?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.43,0:14:46.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Card. If that had been one of my zombie\Ncards, I could have clobbered it bones.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.33,0:14:52.43,Default,,0,0,0,,where's all your spooky chatter now you\Nlittle creep play your next card whatever it
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.51,0:14:56.07,Default,,0,0,0,,is i'm ready oh i have to play a zombie
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.15,0:14:59.77,Default,,0,0,0,,card no not that one bones second card to
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.85,0:15:05.59,Default,,0,0,0,,the left huh the crawling dragon this
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.67,0:15:08.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Isn't a zombie card\Neither. As soon as I play
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.81,0:15:14.29,Default,,0,0,0,,it he'll obliterate me just like last\Ntime look i know you don't like it just be
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.37,0:15:19.49,Default,,0,0,0,,patient bones we're working on a strategy\Nhere remember no duelist has ever beaten
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.57,0:15:22.71,Default,,0,0,0,,banded keith without sheep yeah until
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.79,0:15:26.93,Default,,0,0,0,,now defense mode running from me already
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.01,0:15:29.31,Default,,0,0,0,,skull face you're not so scary after all
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.39,0:15:34.71,Default,,0,0,0,,huh go axe raider slice him and dice him
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.57,0:15:41.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah! I win!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.63,0:15:45.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Now play the card that's\Non the far right. Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.45,0:15:49.45,Default,,0,0,0,,You heard me, and don't\Nuse defense mode this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.67,0:15:54.83,Default,,0,0,0,,If the dweeb can't see your monster, he\Nmight just hesitate and wait to attack. Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.21,0:15:59.09,Default,,0,0,0,,If you don't want to trust me,\NBones, I'll keep my advice to myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.17,0:16:00.37,Default,,0,0,0,,It's up to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.33,0:16:04.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Um...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.24,0:16:06.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Crass Clown, in attack mode!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.89,0:16:11.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that the best you've got?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.37,0:16:13.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Flame Swordsman!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.15,0:16:16.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.85,0:16:23.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Flaming Sword of Battle!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.69,0:16:29.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Too bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.09,0:16:31.68,Default,,0,0,0,,One Crass Clown going down.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.67,0:16:36.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Creepshow's scared.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.99,0:16:40.17,Default,,0,0,0,,I got him on the run, and I\Nplan to keep him that way.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.73,0:16:43.95,Default,,0,0,0,,There's way too much ride on\Nthis duel for me to blow it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.03,0:16:46.15,Default,,0,0,0,,My sister Serenity's counting on me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.91,0:16:48.53,Default,,0,0,0,,So watch out, Skullface.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.91,0:16:50.15,Default,,0,0,0,,You better be scared.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.51,0:16:52.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Because this little puppy\Ndog is going to chase
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.67,0:16:55.44,Default,,0,0,0,,your bony butt right out\Nof your own graveyard.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.03,0:16:58.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Now what?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.73,0:17:00.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Just relax.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.05,0:17:03.25,Default,,0,0,0,,You've already got this duel won, Bones.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.33,0:17:06.80,Default,,0,0,0,,What's the problem, Bones can't\Nfight this duel on his own?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.07,0:17:09.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe your coach wants to take me out.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.35,0:17:11.53,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll cream him too. Oh, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.87,0:17:15.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks like you need a lesson\Nin strategy, tweed. Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.51,0:17:25.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow, I had totally forgotten\Nabout this magic card boss now.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.51,0:17:26.37,Default,,0,0,0,,I understand
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.87,0:17:30.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Lay it down, bones. Play your\Ntrump card. You're finished!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.09,0:17:33.05,Default,,0,0,0,,This magic card is unstoppable!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.87,0:17:35.95,Default,,0,0,0,,The Call of the Haunted!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.79,0:17:38.75,Default,,0,0,0,,The Call of the Haunted?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.07,0:17:42.84,Default,,0,0,0,,It brings all of the monsters you\Ndestroyed back from the grave!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.11,0:17:47.01,Default,,0,0,0,,But they come back as zombies\Nwith the power of immortality!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.23,0:17:55.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh no! Oh no!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.61,0:18:05.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Tristan, look.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.77,0:18:08.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, that's Joey's wallet.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.13,0:18:11.42,Default,,0,0,0,,With a picture of his sister, Serenity.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.11,0:18:14.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Joey would never be careless\Nenough to lose that.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.79,0:18:16.91,Default,,0,0,0,,His sister means more\Nto him than anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.99,0:18:19.69,Default,,0,0,0,,This is starting to smell like foul play.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.31,0:18:21.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Look over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.85,0:18:22.89,Default,,0,0,0,,A cave.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.31,0:18:25.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't like the look of this.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.27,0:18:27.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Neither do I.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.75,0:18:35.53,Default,,0,0,0,,What is this place?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.57,0:18:38.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Be careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.91,0:18:40.68,Default,,0,0,0,,It could be some kind of trap.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.99,0:18:42.70,Default,,0,0,0,,What's up with those coffins?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.75,0:18:44.69,Default,,0,0,0,,It's me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.85,0:18:46.71,Default,,0,0,0,,You could leave them just standing here.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.79,0:18:47.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.70,0:18:49.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I wouldn't touch those guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.09,0:18:49.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Be careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.43,0:18:51.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't be silly.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.59,0:18:52.99,Default,,0,0,0,,It's just a wooden b...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.07,0:18:54.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh... Huh? Whoa?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.51,0:18:56.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa? Whoa?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.27,0:18:58.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah! Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.33,0:19:00.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh! Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.29,0:19:02.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Got it!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.41,0:19:03.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.21,0:19:08.27,Default,,0,0,0,,That Pegasus has sure got\Na sick sense of humor.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.63,0:19:10.11,Default,,0,0,0,,You said it, Tristan.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.81,0:19:18.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Your monsters are back.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.87,0:19:22.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Call of the Haunted brought all\Nof them back from the grave,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.01,0:19:24.42,Default,,0,0,0,,and they're zombies now.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.53,0:19:25.41,Default,,0,0,0,,They're zombies?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.49,0:19:30.81,Default,,0,0,0,,And as zombies, they all gain a field\Npower bonus from this graveyard field.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.25,0:19:40.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Dragon Zombie, attack the Axe Raider!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.81,0:19:45.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Axe Raider, bash that lizard!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.83,0:19:48.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh no!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.29,0:19:51.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Direct hit and the Zombie Dragon recover!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.11,0:19:54.83,Default,,0,0,0,,There's zombies now, Dweeb.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.91,0:19:56.85,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't destroy him with an axe.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.93,0:19:57.77,Default,,0,0,0,,What? Oh, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.87,0:20:01.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, yes, dragon zombie.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.39,0:20:02.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Destroy Axe Raider.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.29,0:20:04.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Deadly zombie breath.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.73,0:20:06.56,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.73,0:20:11.09,Default,,0,0,0,,One down and one to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.33,0:20:16.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Now your puny swordsman is\Noutnumbered three to one.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.41,0:20:17.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.63,0:20:18.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Now what am I going to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.97,0:20:20.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Nothing can kill those monsters.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.73,0:20:23.11,Default,,0,0,0,,I blew it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.35,0:20:25.31,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm dead meat.
